[{"title":"挽少师姚公广孝三首 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"早负经纶济世才，翩然杖锡谒金台。\n孔明原自隆中起，仲晦都传蓟北来。\n翊赞圣明清宇宙，吹嘘贤俊出尘埃。\n功成特拜三孤命，烈烈声光际上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽少师姚公广孝三首 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"七十之年自古稀，多公眉寿接期颐。\n童颜鹤发神仙侣，玉带朱衣太子师。\n报国有心频献策，退朝无事只哦诗。\n如今乘化逍遥去，玄塔风生草树悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽少师姚公广孝三首 其三","author":"夏原吉","text":"昔年奉命赈东吴，怀抱相亲过友于。\n月下诗成频属和，花前酒尽更令沽。\n剑池访古肩舆并，笠泽寻幽画舫俱。\n回首旧游今已矣，忆公空有泪如珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽王主事希范","author":"夏原吉","text":"正喜南官秩任荣，俄惊天上玉楼成。\n逍遥一笑骑鲸去，寂寞何年化鹤鸣。\n圣主恩深归旅榇，严尊泪尽哭铭旌。\n悬知瘗玉钱塘麓，潮咽无声江自横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽冯筠窗","author":"夏原吉","text":"先生早悟易中玄，用舍行藏总付天。\n架上青编时教子，床头绿蚁日招贤。\n俄惊半夜舟移壑，遽逐层霄鹤化仙。\n宰木萧萧风露冷，山阳笛调谩悽然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽曾秬","author":"夏原吉","text":"忆昔垂髫见我初，英英气宇陋童乌。\n谁知白玉楼徵记，遽使丹山凤失雏。\n讣入庭闱深慨惜，诗传朝野共嗟吁。\n何由高擘匡庐石，为勒遗文立墓隅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过尚书严公墓有怀","author":"夏原吉","text":"昔年曾共立彤墀，鹤发虬髯动主知。\n岂谓初辞天府政，驾言长赴夜台期。\n郁葱佳地藏簪笏，窈窕丰碑刻岁时。\n愧我客边无藻荐，倚风酸鼻为吟诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39157,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登黄鹤楼","author":"夏原吉","text":"黄鹤高楼郡城外，黄鹤去后曾来不。\n江山万古复万古，草木一秋仍一秋。\n崔颢有诗人少和，仲宣无事何多忧。\n呼童携我船内酒，来此邀取仙人讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39158,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠微书舍","author":"夏原吉","text":"可人书屋翠微中，景趣鹅湖岳麓同。\n风引溪云侵几湿，月将松影入帘重。\n十年坐阅芸边蠹，一举高攀天上龙。\n珍重山灵莫相忆，白头归眺更从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39159,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪轩","author":"夏原吉","text":"溧水先生海内英，一轩白白雪为名。\n夜窗月照梅无影，晓槛风生鹤有声。\n清素真为君子宅，虚明尤称主人情。\n何当载酒携松竹，来结轩中岁晚盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39160,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题乡人何养素鹡鸰图","author":"夏原吉","text":"嘤嘤黄鸟自求朋，友爱安能比鹡鸰。\n点尾摇头知有急，飘声随影岂无情。\n信知结袂交游谊，未若弯弓涕泣诚。\n珍重何郎知此意，画图莫作等閒评。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39161,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云林清隐","author":"夏原吉","text":"缥缈堆深万木低，幽人此地学栖迟。\n满帘虚白月生处，一榻空青雨过时。\n酒熟每招麋鹿友，身閒肯羡凤凰池。\n炉香静课佛书罢，细看轮囷变态奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39162,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题道士凌虚楼","author":"夏原吉","text":"道人乐道厌喧啾，直倚层空架此楼。\n万顷风云生榻底，一天星斗布檐头。\n黄庭夜数犀珠读，玄圃时凭鹤背游。\n安得我身无俗事，也来个里学清修。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39163,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和僧白鹇诗二首 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"双颊彤彤点绛纱，满身霜拂更光华。\n栖来晚树烟笼叶，叫落春山雨湿花。\n曾逐绣衣朝帝阙，偶随珠句到禅家。\n主人料得相看好，不用昂头羡野霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39164,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和僧白鹇诗二首 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"醉涂玄鹤顶丹砂，閒住山中几岁华。\n虞网忽迷三面雨，樊笼身掩一身花。\n永怀五柳先生宅，静忆孤山处士家。\n若向风前轻脱钥，高张云翼趁飞霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39165,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应制赋瑞应玄兔诗","author":"夏原吉","text":"圣皇御宇万方宁，和气冲融品物亨。\n列宿储精生瑞兔，守臣驰牍贡神京。\n露滋黭黮玄云湿，日映晶荧黑玉明。\n行傍缁帷人莫见，立当瑶砌鹤先惊。\n渴来净吸龙池水，饥后时餐御苑苹。\n赫赫四灵端可并，纷纷六扰岂能并。\n祇惭贱质无才学，叨列清班荷宠荣。\n惕惕深怀天地德，兢兢莫致草茅诚。\n今逢藩阃呈嘉瑞，敢靳微言颂太平。\n百拜金门陈短什，咏歌聊以效嵩鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋徽宗所画墨竹","author":"夏原吉","text":"宝殿无心论治安，碧窗著意写琅玕。\n枝枝叶叶真潇洒，争奈金人不爱看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题元臣王熙端本堂所临宣和雪天芦雁图 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"宣和失驭宋纲堕，端本堂臣素所知。\n何事不陈车覆戒，却临图画媚当时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题元臣王熙端本堂所临宣和雪天芦雁图 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"图画临来笔颇精，小窗閒玩足娱情。\n祇怜万里边城远，毳辇宵奔载不行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵春日书怀二首 其一","author":"夏原吉","text":"凌晨惆怅日行云，目断行云更怆神。\n万里一身归未得，高堂谁慰白头亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵春日书怀二首 其二","author":"夏原吉","text":"飘飘书剑泊天涯，每到春来辄念家。\n料得故园桃李树，东风吹处一般花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题许侍郎所藏许由弃瓢图","author":"夏原吉","text":"耳边方厌一瓢声，心外宁贪万乘荣。\n可羡后来嘉遁客，谩欺林壑盗虚名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题虎石翁万玉图一首","author":"夏原吉","text":"长枝短枝不著地，千花万花都是春。\n纷纷世上桃与李，何尔妖媚欺时人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白茆港","author":"夏原吉","text":"图伯争雄浚白茆，万夫执役不胜劳。\n那知畚锸声初歇，已有真人著柘袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孔明","author":"夏原吉","text":"八阵图成已绝伦，出师二表更忠勤。\n可怜五丈星宵殒，后主含酸入魏军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潇湘夜雨","author":"夏原吉","text":"二女南来正断魂，那堪风雨又黄昏。\n潇潇无限相思泪，都作江边竹上痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞庭秋月","author":"夏原吉","text":"万籁无声玉宇清，君山推出一轮明。\n婵娟倒蘸寒波底，惊起鱼龙梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔村夕照","author":"夏原吉","text":"罢钓分鱼各系船，家家晾网荻花边。\n数声欸乃炊烟尽，犹有馀晖在树巅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山市晴岚","author":"夏原吉","text":"翠微深处簇村廛，茅屋参差树色鲜。\n欲向个中沽一醉，冥濛不见酒旗悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"随侍太孙殿下回南京途中观射雉","author":"夏原吉","text":"野雉惊飞入半空，皇孙驰马试雕弓。\n一声金镝云间响，五色离披堕晓风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦亲","author":"夏原吉","text":"梦里见亲亲色好，更能绕膝戏莱衣。\n觉来依旧金陵馆，望断白云心欲飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢乡友慕宗谅寄暮云春树图","author":"夏原吉","text":"寄来图画景何新，春树迢迢隔暮云。\n安得好风吹健翮，洞庭湖上重寻君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己卯春同中书舍人吴均入闽观风出京口占","author":"夏原吉","text":"晓驾轺车出凤城，柳花风煖绣衣轻。\n入闽料得无多路，不向征徒问去程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中谩兴","author":"夏原吉","text":"片帆二月过吴门，眼底相看物物新。\n惟有溪桥桃与李，著花浑似故园春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将赴华亭","author":"夏原吉","text":"踏遍姑苏水与山，又将拨棹向云间。\n岸花汀鸟休相笑，自是吾生不爱闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":39185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa9828